    71	5. **Kaggle Kernel Multi-Substrate Execution (`kaggle_kernel/`, `scripts/kaggle_run.py`)**
    72	   - **CPU Kernels**: Kaggle Python 3.13 container, image numpy/scipy/sympy/torch,
