picture-codex.md:95:| **MultigradedImplicitization** | Test whether a verified grading splits the actual quotient-map problem into substantially smaller blocks. The installed package targets homogeneous kernels of polynomial maps; applicability here needs demonstration. [`package:457–467`](/usr/share/Macaulay2/MultigradedImplicitization.m2:457) | Trivial grading, weak block reduction, or an encoding that changes \(J\) or the desired fiber. |
